  "_comment": "What the shared dailies deal. 'pool': the prompts the daily and the Daily Quiz may use, hand-picked so a typical IOAI contestant can answer at once (syllabus concepts and well-known names, like 'Name an optimizer'); practice-heavy prompts (RAG, PEFT, quantization formats, special tokens, pandas, sklearn utilities...) stay out and remain in Unlimited, Quiz and live rooms. A new prompt joins the daily only when added here. 'launch': the launch week, seven days of seven pool prompts played in order from launch day (LAUNCH in js/engine.js), easiest first. Before launch the daily deals the whole pool, fresh each day; after the launch week the shuffle starts with the pool prompts the week didn't use. 'quiz': the Daily Quiz's hand-picked days from launch, seven questions from data/reasoning.json each, easy ones first; after them it deals the whole bank. Before launch the Daily Quiz deals the whole bank, fresh each day.",
